dsh-perf-review

The bundled perf-review skill includes material adapted from the perf-review,
webperf-review, concurrency, resource, database, and cache reviews in
maci0/gauntlet (https://github.com/maci0/gauntlet), identified in this
repository as AGPL-3.0 material. The distributed package is AGPL-3.0-only.

